  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The kit is functional as the standard curve looks good, and the QC samples is within the expected range. However, it did not detect any of the either regular or ethanol-extracted serum samples. The spike recovery for both regular and ethanol-extracted samples ~87%. I don't think it is matrix effect. I think the coated antigen has limitation to bind equine serum leptin as this kit is designed for the detection of human blood leptin."
  },
